    <innerclass refid="class_view" prot="public">View</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for a view in the MVC pattern, handling logging and RunMode titles. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file defines the <computeroutput><ref refid="class_view" kindref="compound">View</ref></computeroutput> class, which provides the interface for views in the Weaver simulation framework. It includes methods for logging messages, both normal and error messages, and maintains a mapping of <computeroutput>RunMode</computeroutput> enum values to displayable titles. </para>
